{"id":"d3f349b5-455b-459f-8f99-90a20bd90e1d","created":1787764013,"model":"sensenova-6.8-flash-lite","object":"chat.completion","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"\n\n{\"facts\":[{\"fact\":\"冷库的温控器在午前跳闸\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"冷库的温控器在午前跳闸\"},{\"fact\":\"整箱荔枝很快开始渗水\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"整箱荔枝很快开始渗水\"},{\"fact\":\"裴小棠是仓管\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"仓管裴小棠\"},{\"fact\":\"裴小棠把这批货从“待发”改成“报损”\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"裴小棠把这批货从“待发”改成“报损”\"},{\"fact\":\"裴小棠通知司机取消下午那趟去港东批发市场的车\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"并通知司机取消下午那趟去港东批发市场的车\"},{\"fact\":\"司机回复“知道了”\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"司机回了一句“知道了”\"},{\"fact\":\"司机把已经发动的货车熄了火\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"便把已经发动的货车熄了火\"},{\"fact\":\"渗出水顺着托盘流到地面\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"渗出水顺着托盘流到地面\"},{\"fact\":\"裴小棠去拿拖把\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"裴小棠又去拿拖把\"}]}","reasoning":"Let me analyze this chapter carefully and extract all facts.\n\nThe chapter is short. Let me identify the facts:\n\n1. 冷库的温控器在午前跳闸 - The cold storage temperature controller tripped before noon.\n2. 整箱荔枝很快开始渗水 - The whole boxes of lychees quickly started leaking water.\n3. 仓管裴小棠把这批货从\"待发\"改成\"报损\" - Warehouse manager Pei Xiaotang changed this batch from \"pending shipment\" to \"damaged goods\".\n4. 裴小棠通知司机取消下午那趟去港东批发市场的车 - Pei Xiaotang notified the driver to cancel the afternoon trip to Gangdong wholesale market.\n5. 司机回了一句\"知道了\" - The driver replied \"got it\".\n6. 司机把已经发动的货车熄了火 - The driver turned off the already-started truck.\n7. 渗出水顺着托盘流到地面 - The leaked water flowed along the pallet to the ground.\n8. 裴小棠又去拿拖把 - Pei Xiaotang went to get a mop.\n\nLet me structure these properly.\n\nFact 1: 冷库温控器在午前跳闸\n- status: 已发生\n- evidence: \"冷库的温控器在午前跳闸\"\n\nFact 2: 整箱荔枝很快开始渗水\n- status: 已发生\n- evidence: \"整箱荔枝很快开始渗水\"\n\nFact 3: 裴小棠身份是仓管\n- status: 已发生\n- evidence: \"仓管裴小棠\"\n\nFact 4: 裴小棠把货从\"待发\"改成\"报损\"\n- status: 已发生\n- evidence: \"裴小棠把这批货从\"待发\"改成\"报损\"\"\n\nFact 5: 裴小棠通知司机取消下午去港东批发市场的车\n- status: 已发生\n- evidence: \"并通知司机取消下午那趟去港东批发市场的车\"\n\nFact 6: 司机回复\"知道了\"\n- status: 已发生\n- evidence: \"司机回了一句\"知道了\"\"\n\nFact 7: 司机把已经发动的货车熄了火\n- status: 已发生\n- evidence: \"便把已经发动的货车熄了火\"\n\nFact 8: 渗出水顺着托盘流到地面\n- status: 已发生\n- evidence: \"渗出水顺着托盘流到地面\"\n\nFact 9: 裴小棠去拿拖把\n- status: 已发生\n- evidence: \"裴小棠又去拿拖把\"\n\nLet me check if there are any plans or commitments. The driver said \"知道了\" - this is a verbal response, could be considered an acknowledgment but not necessarily a commitment. I'll keep it as a speech event.\n\nThe notification to cancel the trip - the driver acknowledged. But did the driver commit? \"知道了\" is acknowledgment. I'll record the speech event.\n\nLet me finalize.\n"},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1593,"completion_tokens":925,"total_tokens":2518,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}},"request_id":"d3f349b5-455b-459f-8f99-90a20bd90e1d"}
